text = "[color=#A8F0C6][b]1. Visual Estimation:[/b][/color] Quickly estimate quantities or choose which side has more dots without counting one by one!

[color=#A8F0C6][b]2. Target Reaction:[/b][/color] Tap all requested targets (colors or shapes) before the timer runs out.

[color=#F43F5E][b]3. Don't Tap / Inhibition:[/b][/color] Pay attention to the instructions! If instructed not to tap, keep your hands off the screen to earn points.

[color=#A8F0C6][b]4. Scoring:[/b][/color] Speed bonus awarded for fast correct answers. Wrong answers receive a penalty!"

